  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_7687.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">La Asociaci&oacute;n Riu Sec de Onda ha celebrado como cada a&ntilde;o sus jornadas de puertas abiertas frente a su local en la calle Metge Jos&eacute; Llid&oacute;, esta vez coincidiendo con la Noche de San Juan. Por tercer a&ntilde;o consecutivo, la presentaci&oacute;n ha corrido a cargo de la actriz ondense Maite Gil.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7550.jpg\" alt=\"img_7550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7551.jpg\" alt=\"img_7551\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7552.jpg\" alt=\"img_7552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7553.jpg\" alt=\"img_7553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7554.jpg\" alt=\"img_7554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7555.jpg\" alt=\"img_7555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7556.jpg\" alt=\"img_7556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesriusec17/img_7557.jpg\" alt=\"img_7557\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/portesobertesr